{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25029","headline":"放萤怨 · 刘言史","name":"放萤怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"放萤去，不须留，聚时年少今白头。\n架中科斗万余卷，一字千回重照见。\n青云杳渺不可亲，开囊欲放增余怨。\n且逍遥，还酩酊，仲舒漫不窥园井。\n那将寂寞老病身，更就微虫借光影。\n欲放时，泪沾裳，冲篱落，千点光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘言史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}